ee (Prunus persica)","termine_origine":"*persik","catena":[{"codice":"gmw-pro","nome":"Proto-West Germanic","termine":"*persik","categoria":"ereditato"},{"codice":"la-lat","nome":"Late Latin","termine":"persicum","categoria":"latinismo_dotto"}],"lontana":"la-lat","ambiti":["cucina"],"via":"","testo":"From Middle Dutch perseke, from Old Dutch *persika, from Proto-West Germanic *persik, ultimately borrowed from Late Latin persicum, persica."},{"parola":"spijker","pos":"noun","n_etimologia":2,"categoria":"ereditato","incerta":"no","significato":"granary","termine_origine":"*spīkārī","catena":[{"codice":"gmw-pro","nome":"Proto-West Germanic","termine":"*spīkārī","categoria":"ereditato"},{"codice":"la-lat","nome":"Late Latin","termine":"spīcārium","categoria":"non_precisato"}],"lontana":"la-lat","ambiti":[],"via":"","testo":"From Middle Dutch spīker, from Old Dutch *spīkāri, from Proto-West Germanic *spīkārī, from Late Latin spīcārium. Compare German Speicher, Old Saxon spīkari."}]}